Vendored from https://github.com/arscan/encom-globe (MIT)
and the Three r122 port in https://github.com/jose-acevedoflores/encom-globe-react.

LineGeometry.js and a few Three 0.171 API shims (BufferGeometry index,
vertexColors, Sprite.scale.set) are the only local edits. Visual behavior
is the original Encom hex globe: tiles, intro lines, pins, markers, smoke,
satellites.
